        "gg6Qfv_w9rX_text": "<p>Yes. This product does not conflict with caffeine.<br>However, many users find they <strong>naturally rely less on coffee</strong> over time as their baseline energy becomes more stable.</p>",
        "ggBrNUefbIO_text": "<p>That’s normal — and expected.<br>This product is designed to improve <strong>how you feel across the entire day</strong>, not deliver a noticeable “kick.”</p><p>If you feel <strong>less drained at the end of the day</strong>, more consistent focus, and better recovery — it’s working.</p>",
        "ggDTV4bMmJD_text": "<p>Yes. If you don’t feel it fits your routine or expectations, you’re covered by our <strong>30-day satisfaction guarantee</strong>.</p>",
        "ggQ7URffj8X_text": "frequently asked questions",
        "ggQPtNMDjxY_text": "<p>Simply take <strong>one serving per day</strong>, ideally at the same time each day.<br>No cycling, no stacking, no complex timing required.</p><p>Consistency matters more than dosage.</p>",
        "ggV49h1K4zn_text": "<p>Most energy products <strong>push your nervous system</strong> for immediate effect.<br>This product focuses on <strong>stability and resilience</strong> — helping you maintain clarity and stamina throughout the day, without crashes, jitters, or overstimulation.</p><p>Think <strong>controlled performance</strong>, not artificial acceleration</p>",
        "ggX1jB7SL_k_text": "<p>This is a <strong>daily longevity bottle</strong> designed to support long-term energy, mental endurance, and recovery — without relying on stimulants.<br>It works by supporting the body’s <strong>foundational systems</strong> (cellular energy, stress response, and recovery), not by forcing short-term “boosts.”</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_0": "<p>What exactly is this product?</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_1": "<p>How is this different from energy drinks or nootropics?</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_2": "<p>When will I start noticing effects?</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_3": "<p>How do I take it?</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_4": "<p>Can I take this with coffee?</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_5": "<p>What if I don’t feel a dramatic change?</p>",
        "ggtJ5dzRgxF_childItem_6": "<p>Is there a guarantee?</p>",
        "ggvHcwUAq-Z_text": "<p>Many users report subtle improvements in <strong>mental clarity and energy stability within the first 7–14 days</strong>.<br>Deeper benefits — such as better focus endurance, improved sleep quality, and faster recovery — typically become more noticeable with <strong>consistent daily use over 30+ days</strong>.</p><p>Longevity works gradually, not instantly.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-622310912325321720"
    },
